    <description lang="cs_CZ">Nainstaluj tento repozitar jednou a Kodi bude doplnek ABCKASEFI aktualizovat samo. Zdroj: github.com/mirecekd/plugin.video.abckasefi</description>
    <platform>all</platform>
    <license>MIT</license>
    <source>https://github.com/mirecekd/plugin.video.abckasefi</source>
    <assets>
      <icon>icon.png</icon>
    </assets>
    <news>1.0.1 - New icon in the Copper colours of www.mirecek.org.</news>
  </extension>
</addon>
